@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC08 Gui hinh anh noi dung POI

actor "Vendor" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebAdminUI - MediaLibraryPage tab Hinh anh" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nMediaController + MediaService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nMediaRepository + PoiRepository + DbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Chon POI va file anh
UI -> UI: Kiem tra da chon file
UI -> Business: Gui file va poiId
Business -> Business: Kiem tra role Vendor va che do chi cho phep anh
Business -> DataAccess: Doc POI va owner
DataAccess -> Database: Doc du lieu POI
Database --> DataAccess: Tra POI
DataAccess --> Business: Tra ket qua
alt POI ton tai va thuoc Vendor
  Business -> Business: Kiem tra loai file, kich thuoc va phan mo rong
  alt File hop le
    Business -> Business: Luu file vao vung upload
    Business -> DataAccess: Tao MediaFile trang thai Pending
    DataAccess -> Database: Ghi metadata anh va nguoi gui
    Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
    DataAccess --> Business: Tra media moi
    Business --> UI: Tra anh cho duyet
    UI --> Actor: Cap nhat danh sach va thong bao thanh cong
  else File khong hop le
    Business --> UI: Tra loi dinh dang hoac kich thuoc
    UI --> Actor: Hien thi loi upload
  end
else POI khong ton tai hoac sai owner
  Business --> UI: Tra loi khong co quyen
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi loi
end
@enduml
